Package: resin-print-portal
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Michiel Bruijn <MichielBruijn@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-flask (>= 2.2), python3-cryptography, systemd
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/MichielBruijn/Resin-Print-Portal
Description: web interface for Elegoo resin printers (SDCP)
 Resin Print Portal (RPP) uploads .ctb/.goo files to an Elegoo resin printer
 such as the Mars 4 Ultra and starts, pauses and stops prints over the LAN.
 It shows progress, print height and slicer previews, can mix the resin,
 and publishes the printer status to Home Assistant over MQTT.
 .
 The web interface listens on port 5001 (see /etc/default/resin-print-portal).
